WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:03.002
-Welcome back.
I am here with Ken Jeong.

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.671
And since Halloween
is this weekend,

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:07.040
Ken and I are about to play
a spooky game.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.375
It's time for a "Tonight Show"
"Freaky Face-Off."

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:11.477
-♪ Freaky ♪

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:13.346
-♪ Face-off ♪

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.481
-♪ Freaky ♪

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:18.017
-♪ Face-off ♪

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:20.219
-Alright.
Now, here's how this works.

00:00:20.219 --> 00:00:21.787
Right here in our Zoom window,

00:00:21.787 --> 00:00:23.790
we are going to show you
a freaky face.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.225
It could be a Halloween mask,

00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:27.660
it could be a jack-o'-lantern,
but it is going to be scary.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:28.861
And then we're going to
take turns

00:00:28.861 --> 00:00:31.731
trying to re-create that
freaky face live.

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:33.699
Sound good?
-Sounds great.

00:00:33.699 --> 00:00:36.669
-Alright, here we go.
First freaky face is for you.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:37.670
Check it out.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:40.673
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:41.674
Alright.

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:44.878
Ken, try to re-create the face.

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:49.782
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:00:49.782 --> 00:00:51.251
Terrifying.

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:52.685
That was really good, actually.
I like it.

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:56.522
Alright. Alright. Here we go.
Now it is my turn.

00:00:56.522 --> 00:00:57.523
Here we go.
-Okay.

00:00:57.523 --> 00:01:00.126
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:03.096
Okay. That's the face?
This way?

00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:09.702
[ Thunder crashes ]
-Oh, my God. Oh, my God.

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:12.138
Someone give him
some caffeine, stat.

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:13.640
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.275
-I can probably
do better than that.

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:17.376
I don't know.
-A sleepy zombie! Oh, no!

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:18.645
-So, his mouth is down.

00:01:18.645 --> 00:01:20.946
Wait. His mouth is down.
Can I try it one more time?

00:01:20.946 --> 00:01:23.115
-Yeah, yeah. Yeah.
-Alright.

00:01:23.115 --> 00:01:25.552
Like that, and then...

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:29.355
[ Thunder crashes ]
-Oh, my God.

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:32.458
You look like Joel McHale
when he's drowsy.

00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:36.362
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:41.000
-Ken, it is your turn.
It is your turn again.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.067
Here we go.

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:45.105
[ Thunder crashes ]
Ooh!

00:01:48.874 --> 00:01:50.910
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:01:54.113 --> 00:01:56.382
Dude, I want a doll
that looks like that.

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:59.018
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:01.654
Okay, let's see.
-What am I doing?

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:04.256
-Okay, here we go.

00:02:04.256 --> 00:02:06.860
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.394
Okay.

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:16.502
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:02:16.502 --> 00:02:19.705
-Well, time to eat your
running shoe, Jimmy.

00:02:19.705 --> 00:02:21.673
[ Both laugh ]

00:02:21.673 --> 00:02:24.510
-That's how I unlock my iPhone.
I put my foot on it.

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:25.811
5-You put your foot on it.

00:02:25.811 --> 00:02:28.414
-It reads my foot, and no one
else can open my iPhone.

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:30.382
And, actually,
that's how I open my doors is,

00:02:30.382 --> 00:02:31.550
I put my foot in it.

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:34.053
Oh, God. Sorry.

00:02:34.053 --> 00:02:37.723
This last one is for both of us.

00:02:37.723 --> 00:02:40.426
So we'll both have to
match this freaky face.

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:41.527
Let's see it.

00:02:41.527 --> 00:02:43.929
[ Thunder crashes ]
Okay, ready?

00:02:43.929 --> 00:02:46.499
1, 2, 3...

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:48.368
Oh, my God.

00:02:52.371 --> 00:02:54.773
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:02:54.773 --> 00:02:57.776
-You damn kids.
You damn kids step on my face!

00:02:57.776 --> 00:03:00.547
You damn kids.
-My thanks to Ken Jeong.

